     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>A well-defined set clearly communicates whether the element is a member of the set or not. You can list the names of the twelve people who had walked on the moon as of March 12, 2021.</p>\n<p><i>M</i> = {Neil Armstrong, Edwin “Buzz” Aldrin, Charles “Pete” Conrad, Alan Bean, Alan Shepard Jr., Edgar Mitchell, David Scott, James Irwin, John Young, Charles Duke, Eugene Cernan, Harrison Schmitt}</p>"
